    'port_label(''output'', 1, ''out'');'}, newline)
    'FluxVectorController/ReferenceGenerator', 'ReferenceGenerator (motulator)', 'Flux and torque reference generator (ReferenceGenerator) with the lookup tables of the MTPA, MTPV, and current-limit loci, computed by the function sm_reference_luts.m of the library in the mask initialization (Simulink) or by the block at the start (PLECS). The output ref is [psi_s tau_M], the flux reference and the limited torque reference. The machine model par is a struct with the fields n_p, R_s, L_d, L_q, and psi_f of SynchronousMachinePars, or n_p, R_s, and psi_s_dq_fcn (a GradNet flux map) of SaturatedSynchronousMachinePars.', strjoin({ ...
    '% Fields of the machine model par for the C-Script: SynchronousMachinePars, or', ...
    '% SaturatedSynchronousMachinePars with a GradNet flux map psi_s_dq_fcn', ...
    'par_n_p = par.n_p;', ...
    'par_R_s = par.R_s;', ...
    'if isfield(par, ''psi_s_dq_fcn'') && ~isempty(par.psi_s_dq_fcn)', ...
    '  par_L_d = [];', ...
    '  par_L_q = [];', ...
    '  par_psi_f = [];', ...
    '  gn_in_dim = par.psi_s_dq_fcn.in_dim;', ...
    '  gn_mu_dim = par.psi_s_dq_fcn.mu_dim;', ...
    '  gn_W = par.psi_s_dq_fcn.W;', ...
    '  gn_b = par.psi_s_dq_fcn.b;', ...
    '  gn_mu_log = par.psi_s_dq_fcn.mu_log;', ...
    '  gn_bias = par.psi_s_dq_fcn.bias;', ...
    '  gn_activation = par.psi_s_dq_fcn.activation;', ...
    '  gn_beta_log = par.psi_s_dq_fcn.beta_log;', ...
    '  gn_p = par.psi_s_dq_fcn.p;', ...
    '  gn_in_base = par.psi_s_dq_fcn.in_base;', ...
    '  gn_out_base = par.psi_s_dq_fcn.out_base;', ...
    'else', ...
